    "detailed_description": "You're a cat in a world of islands. You can explore, craft, build, destroy, collect drops Don't worry about monsters, no one will attack you. But you have to care about food, stamina and economy!<br><br>The game will have an update every Monday.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003840/extras/8d9bc2fe6b8e2ffb189fc17867e0be2c.poster.avif?t=1668120314\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003840/extras/8d9bc2fe6b8e2ffb189fc17867e0be2c.webm?t=1668120314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003840/extras/8d9bc2fe6b8e2ffb189fc17867e0be2c.mp4?t=1668120314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong><br>Build and destroy whatever you want! The world is yours.<br><br>Cultivate vegetables<br><br>Find the best place to create a big and productive farm. <br><br>Create your cute home<br><br>Go mine to discover minerals and go deep to find rare ore. Care about stamina and food, taking with you some food it's not a bad idea.<br><br>Your inventory has a small capacity, decide with awareness what to take in your travels. <br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003840/extras/81737ab845580fb01e0107898b2c9a03.poster.avif?t=1668120314\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003840/extras/81737ab845580fb01e0107898b2c9a03.webm?t=1668120314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003840/extras/81737ab845580fb01e0107898b2c9a03.mp4?t=1668120314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>If you have an advice, please tell me. You can write me directly on my socials",
